          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>By expressing <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{1}{2}\\log_3{x}]</span> in the form <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\log_3 \\left(x^k\\right),]</span> determine the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k.]</span></p>",
